{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_utage_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_utage_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "The Tale of Nuegiri",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_utage_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "33ed8d8aea65556f09bfa8132889b7e96c7b984aa74cc0e8aa93b70ef9395775",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bugyou A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hey, do you hear something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bugyou B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bugyou A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I think it's coming from the rooftops."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bugyou A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Kusooooo!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bugyou A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What is that thing?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bugyou B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "A-Accursed monster!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bugyou A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Drive it away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unknown Monster",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "(Roars)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bugyou B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "You've angered it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bugyou C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "A-Aruji-dono! You should not be here! It's dangerous!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Daimyo",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Vile monster! You'll pay for the harm you have done to my people!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Rhodes Island Liaison Office"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "text": "So that's the Higashinese Legend of Nuegiri?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "Yeah. They say that the Nuegiri clan continues to protect a certain prominent Higashinese clan, driving misfortune away and bringing in good fortune."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "text": "But there's no record of this daimyo, or what city he ruled."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "That's because it's legend."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "The goods check out just fine. Same corridor as usual."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "Take a left at that corner there and you'll see a red sign marking the cargo elevator. Closure's storage room is two floors up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "There are three security checkpoints along the way. Just follow the signs and listen to staff instructions."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "You Rhodes Islanders always have so much red tape. Can't we do that 'package for you, just sign here' stuff? Alright, I'll go through the waybills. You go and deliver the goods."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "Me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "text": "Quit babbling and go. Be careful not to get lost. Heaven knows the corridors in this place still confuse me, even though I've been here a bunch of times."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "I'll be going, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "A new Messenger? He's got the look of a first-timer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "text": "That's what this job's like. People come and go all the time. You know how hard logistics work is, with all the dangers out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "What about your old partner, that Parker kid? Did he quit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "text": "He tangled with some beasts on a solo delivery, so he's gone back home to Rim Billiton to recuperate. Not sure how serious it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "Well, glad he's alive, at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "text": "Which is why I got a new partner."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "Uh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "(All the corridors look the same... I'm lost, aren't I?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "There isn't a single soul in sight. How did I even end up here, anyway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "Are you delivering to Closure's storage room?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "Do you need a guide?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "Oh, a schoolgirl? Thank you. Are you a patient here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "An operator too. Wanna see my hall pass?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "Sorry, I just made assumptions because you look so young. May I trouble you to show me the way, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "No prob. Lemme just..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "Hey, you can't take that box!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "Why not? It's for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "But this stuff still needs to go through Rhodes Island's security checks—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "I take care of it myself. Lookie—'Utage,' 'Cosmetics Series.' Happy? Or you think it might be an Originium bomb? How about I open it in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "Well, there's no need for that... it's just... procedure... uh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "Flip around and walk straight until you hit the third door. Take the corner a good twenty meters after that, turn right, then pop down the corridor on the left and walk thirty meters."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "Off you go, now. I got training. Byeee."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "Wait, don't—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "Is that what Rhodes Island operators are like? I guess 'free spirit' is the word for it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "I should tell the people at security that this operator named Utage took one of the packages."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talkative Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "Alright, let's move..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Messenger does not realize that Utage has not left. She is hiding behind a corner, just out of sight.\nUtage holds the box like it is the most precious thing she has ever held.\nShe follows behind the Messenger, completely silent."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "So, you're really into Higashinese myths and legends?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "text": "Of course. That's why I became a Messenger, to see and learn new things. I ask people for local stories wherever I go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "Sounds like a Messenger thing alright. Although, I've actually heard a different version of the Nuegiri legend."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "text": "Oh? Let's hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "Well—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "Today, the city is gone, but it is said that the Nuegiri clan still exists, operating in the shadows."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "Taken under the wing of a major Higashinese clan, they continue to perform their ancestral duties, eliminating all 'Nue' so dubbed by their master."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "...That's the version I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "text": "Such a wildly different story. Fascinating."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Interesting topic of conversation.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "...",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Is that the end of the story?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
          "text": "Doctor! When did you come in?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "The part about the daimyo being cruel and brutal.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
          "text": "Oh, er, don't take it too seriously. I heard it in passing and I can't vouch for its authenticity."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
          "text": "It's just a story. What's a good story without a bit of exaggeration?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
          "text": "Why hasn't the new guy come back yet, though?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
          "text": "Are you here because you're expecting something important, Doctor?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Yes.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "There are a few reports scheduled to be delivered today.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
          "text": "I'm done with the waybills here. We need to go see Closure."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
          "text": "Did that slowpoke really get lost? I'm gonna have words for him."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
          "text": "Huh? What's that?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Cargo Manager",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
          "text": "What's going on?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "An alarm from the storage room.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Let's check it out.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "There are several operators standing by in the corridor leading to Closure's storage room."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What happened?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
          "text": "Someone tripped the thermal alarms. Possible use of combat Arts in the area."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
          "text": "But there's no sign of fighting, only a cartful of goods."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
          "text": "That's the packages we brought in today! There should be a Messenger too. Where is he?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "The operator shakes his head."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
          "text": "We're investigating the incident, Doctor. Please stay with us and be on guard."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "(Observe the corridor)",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
          "text": "Doctor?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Curious Messenger",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
          "text": "A grown man doesn't just vanish into thin air like that, right?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Look here...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "The Doctor crouches by the side of the cart, catching a slight whiff of a certain scent.\nA minute, sweet scent."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Could it be...?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "(Well, that was annoying.)"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Utage looks down at the slightly dented cardboard box in her hands as she mutters irritably."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "(I'm pissed.)"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "Agh! What a pain!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Utage puts the package on the table, along with her katana.\nWith her painstakingly-painted nail-adorned fingers, she takes a small knife and cuts the cardboard box open, revealing a tiny component between the layers of cardboard.\nIt is a delicate component connected to a tiny Originium battery.\nUtage stares at the component. The smile is gone from her face."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "Hello? Do you hear me?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Utage starts talking to the component, obviously a covert listening device."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
          "text": "Doctor, we found the Messenger leaning against a door, far off his route."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
          "text": "He was unconscious, cause unknown."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Must be exhaustion.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Take him to the lounge and let him rest.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
          "text": "But... if he—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
          "text": "This really couldn't be more suspicious—"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Trust me, everything will be alright.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I've checked the area. No sign of anyone.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
          "text": "...If you say so, Doctor. We'll take him to the lounge."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Get the other operators out of here too.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "There was no foul play here.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "I'll file the records.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "I'm only gonna say this once. Doesn't really matter, since you're gonna record it anyway."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "...Ahem."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "I love my life here. I love hanging out with my friends. Everything on Rhodes Island is awesome, way better than the old manor."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "Oh, I don't like training, but I loooooove skipping it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "Which is why—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "If you send a spy to Rhodes Island, I'm gonna pick him out in like, five seconds."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "I don't care which of you is into Rhodes. If you ever pull funny business like this again—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "I'll be back to pay Clan Nuegiri a visit. And then, there won't <i>be</i> a Clan Nuegiri anymore."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "Say hi to Mama and Papa for me."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Utage pivots as she draws her katana.\nCut cleanly in half, the pieces of the listening device fall into the trash can."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "That stupid Messenger just had to try and fight back! He made me spill all this loose powder!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "Maybe I should've given it a bit before slicing the bug. Could've had the folks back home teach him a lesson."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "Gah! I'm PISSED!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Utage does not want to be an assassin or a spy, nor carry the burden of whatever 'ancestral duty' her clan keeps babbling about.\nUtage does not like training. Being an operator can be rather exhausting, after all.\nAll she wants to be is a high-schooler, a real Higashinese <i>JK.</i>"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "Hey! Kirara!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kirara",
          "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
          "text": "Utage-chan!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "What's that? The latest issue?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "No way you're reading it without me!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kirara",
          "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
          "text": "Of course I'm not... I just got it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "Well, whatever. Let's hit up your room and I'll try out some new cosmetics on you!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kirara",
          "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
          "text": "A-Again...?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
